# `charly check` artifacts under <project>/.check/<recipe>/ — per-machine, per-run state that lives
# IN the project tree (so a bed's durable result files stay with the checkout) and must stay OUT of
# git history. This repo's root charly.yml declares disposable beds, so a bed run writes here with
# nothing else ignoring it (opencharly/opencharly#455). The same pattern as charly's own .gitignore.
.check/
